      "message": "feat(post): Siemens Sinumerik 810M post and EMCO VMC-200 machine\n\nClean-room Siemens Sinumerik 810M 3-axis milling post (%MPF, ()\ncomments, G71 mm, G54-G57, L81-L89 R-parameter cycles, G2/G3 I/J/K,\nN9999 and 120-char guards), EMCO VMC-200 machine file, conformance\ngoldens, script suite, and owner air-cut kit.\n\nFixes #2888",
